# Addendum (round 4): the menus task menus open that QS/400 did not ship,
# from Command Entry as phase11/menus.tn does: GO, Page Down for a second
# page, F12 back. A menu the profile may not use (or that does not exist)
# leaves its message on Command Entry, kept as the snapshot.
wait "Main Menu"
timeout 20000
type call qcmd
key enter
wait "Command Entry"
continue
key eraseinput
type go cmnsts
key enter
settle 2000
snap menu-cmnsts
key pgdn
settle 1000
snap menu-cmnsts-2
key reset
key f12
settle 1500
key eraseinput
